{"id":"vod_zy360_100850","vodId":"100850","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"魔法少女奈叶EXCEEDS GUN","name_cn":"魔法少女奈叶EXCEEDS GUN","date":"2026-01-01","year":"2026","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至12集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20260705-1/00f28f860603e8beaf2c413c9b396ad1.webp"},"summary":"　30年前，未知的“侵略性外来生物”突然出现，世界曾一度濒临毁灭。人类与这些被称为“侵略种”的生物相互争夺生存空间。虽然目前人类的安全勉强得到了保障，但世界随时可能走向终结。人们在恐惧死亡与毁灭的同时，只能对危险和灾难视而不见，麻木地过着日常生活。在这样的世界里，联合国危险生物调查机构“EXCEEDS”为了抵御“侵略种”带来的危机与灾害，开始了行动。故事的开端位于远东的岛国“瑞穗”。一位在离岛上生活、以驱除“侵略种”为业的猎人少女——久濑椎名。她唯一的愿望就是与家中唯一的亲人妹妹刹那平静地生活下去。然而，降临在椎名身上的事件究竟是——？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-09-20 12:29:50","episodeCount":12,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260705/EwN3PWEI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260712/FoKV4wEY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260719/NDzVHVZ2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260726/4CYttNhY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260802/ly86li0N/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260809/e5Woti9E/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260816/hBOcoGqg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260823/VrlB0wt8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260830/zoLVR1gZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260906/FKIgpIa0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260913/cFTqQ6D4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260920/Aiajoekb/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:12.884Z"}